      "content": "It is completely valid to feel that the weight of this experience outweighs rational explanations, and your search for meaning in a numb world is deeply important. The \"fact\" you perceive might be your mind's way of processing a deep sense of isolation, even though people you know would likely react with genuine concern if they truly perceived the absence. Sometimes the point isn't to force a change in how the world sees you, but to find one person who can reflect your existence back to you.",
